From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AMD TheRock <noreply@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix swapped SOVERSION/VERSION arguments and stale
 FFTW_VERSION

set_target_properties()'s VERSION and SOVERSION are swapped: VERSION is
meant to control the full installed filename (libfftw3.so.X.Y.Z) and
SOVERSION the embedded -soname the dynamic loader actually resolves
against (libfftw3.so.3). Upstream has them backwards, so the linker
embeds "3.6.9" as the SONAME instead of "3".

No distro's own fftw3 package ships a library literally named
libfftw3.so.3.6.9 (they all use libtool's standard libfftw3.so.3), so a
binary linked against this build's fftw3 can never resolve its runtime
dependency against the system-provided library -- the two SONAMEs never
match.

The replacement VERSION is bumped to 3.6.10 (not the upstream CMake
file's own "3.6.9") to match what the autotools build this replaces
actually produces: autotools derives its libtool version-info
independently of CMake's hardcoded constant, and currently emits
libfftw3.so.3.6.10. The embedded SONAME ("libfftw3.so.3") is identical
either way; only the full installed filename differs, and matching it
avoids anything that looks like a downgrade to whatever already expects
the autotools build's exact filename.

Also bumps FFTW_VERSION, which upstream's CMakeLists.txt still hardcodes
as 3.3.9 even though this project pins and builds the 3.3.10 release
tarball (upstream never bumped this string when 3.3.10 was tagged; the
autotools build derives its own version correctly from the release, so
only the CMake path is affected). FFTW_VERSION feeds the generated
fftw3.pc/fftw3f.pc pkg-config "Version:" field, so anything that checks
`pkg-config --modversion fftw3` or `find_package(FFTW3 3.3.10)` would
see 3.3.9 and could mistake this build for a downgrade relative to the
autotools build it replaces.

See-also: https://github.com/ROCm/TheRock/pull/8527
See-also: https://github.com/ROCm/TheRock/pull/10209
See-also: ROCM-30893
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -279,7 +279,7 @@ if (HAVE_AVX2)
   list (APPEND SOURCEFILES ${fftw_dft_simd_avx2_SOURCE} ${fftw_rdft_simd_avx2_SOURCE})
 endif ()
 
-set (FFTW_VERSION 3.3.9)
+set (FFTW_VERSION 3.3.10)
 
 set (PREC_SUFFIX)
 if (ENABLE_FLOAT)
@@ -356,7 +356,7 @@ if (OPENMP_FOUND)
 endif ()
 
 foreach(subtarget ${subtargets})
-  set_target_properties (${subtarget} PROPERTIES SOVERSION 3.6.9 VERSION 3)
+  set_target_properties (${subtarget} PROPERTIES SOVERSION 3 VERSION 3.6.10)
   install (TARGETS ${subtarget}
 	  RUNTIME DESTINATION ${CMAKE_INSTALL_BINDIR}
 	  LIBRARY DESTINATION ${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR}
--
2.43.0

